### 1. 用户注册
POST http://localhost:8080/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "zhangsan",
  "password": "123456",
  "realName": "张三",
  "phone": "13800138000"
}

### 2. 用户登录
POST http://localhost:8080/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "zhangsan",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 3. 通知列表查询
GET http://localhost:8080/notice/page?pageNum=1&pageSize=10

### 4. 村民提交工单
POST http://localhost:8080/workorder/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "村东头水管坏了",
  "content": "3组村东头水管破裂，水流一地，影响村民用水"
}

### 5. 村干部处理工单
PUT http://localhost:8080/workorder/handle
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "result": "已安排维修人员前往维修，预计下午修好"
}

### 6. 查询工单列表
GET http://localhost:8080/workorder/page?pageNum=1&pageSize=10
